---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import S from '../data/settings.json';
const entity = S.legal.entityName || S.parentName;
---
<Base title="Terms of Use | FV Funding" description="Terms that apply to using the FV Funding website.">
  <PageHero crumbs={[{ label: 'Terms of use' }]} title="Terms of use" text="Last updated: 9 November 2026" />
  <section class="bg-white"><div class="wrap narrow section prose">
    <p>This website is operated by {entity}. By using it, you agree to these terms.</p>
    <h2>Information, not advice</h2>
    <p>Content on this website is general information about business funding. It is not financial, legal or tax advice for your situation, and it is not an offer of credit. Advice is given only after we have understood your case and agreed an engagement in writing.</p>
    <h2>We are not a lender</h2>
    <p>{S.brandName} is an advisory service. Banks and NBFCs make their own credit decisions. We do not guarantee that any loan, limit, rate or scheme benefit will be approved.</p>
    <h2>Bookings</h2>
    <p>A free consultation booked through this website is an introductory discussion and creates no obligation on either side. We may reschedule or decline a booking, and will tell you by email if we do.</p>
    <h2>Fees</h2>
    <p>Any fee for our services is agreed in writing before work begins.</p>
    <h2>Use of the website</h2>
    <p>Please do not misuse the website, submit false information, or attempt to disrupt it. The design, text and brand marks on this website belong to {entity} and may not be copied without permission.</p>
    <h2>Links</h2>
    <p>Links to other websites, including government and lender websites, are for convenience. We are not responsible for their content.</p>
    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>To the extent allowed by law, we are not liable for any loss arising from reliance on general information on this website.</p>
    <h2>Governing law</h2>
    <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India, and the courts at {S.city}, {S.state} have jurisdiction.</p>
    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms; the date above shows the latest version.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
